        {
          "text": "Pele lubuwa luli anze lyantempele amulusie, mutalweeleki, nkaambo lwapegwa bamasi, nkabela munzi mulemu bayooulyataula kumaulu aabo myeezi iili makumi one aibili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.2",
