        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo naakainda mazuba otatwe acisela, muuya wabuumi uuzwa kuli-Leza wakanjila mulimbabo, bakaimikila amaulu aabo, nkabela kwakaba kuyoowa kupati kulimbabo ibakababona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
