              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino bakaswiilila ijwi ipati lizwa kujulu, lyakabaambila kuti, Amutante okuno. Mpawo bakatanta kujulu mukumbi, abalo basinkondonyina bakababona. ",
