        {
          "text": "Lino kuciindi eco ndeonya kwakaba muzuzumo mupati wanyika, wakawisya cipanzi cakumi camunzi, nkabela mumuzuzumo oyo kwakajayigwa bantu bali zyuulu zili musanu azibili, elyo bantu ibakasyaala bakaliyoowede, bakalemeka Leza wakujulu.",
